===Etymology===
From {{etyl|otk|ba}} {{term|bal|lang=otk}}, from {{etyl|trk-pro|ba}} {{term/t|trk-pro|*bạl||honey}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[bɑɫ]|lang=ba}}
* {{hyphenation|бал}}

===Noun===
{{ba-noun}}
# [[honey]]
#: {{usex|Сәскә '''балы'''.|lang=ba|translation=Flower '''honey'''.}}
#: {{usex|Йүкә '''балы''' тәмле, хуш еҫле, ҙур дауалау көсөнә эйә.|lang=ba|translation=Linden '''honey''' is palatable, has a pleasant smell ''(and)'' great medicinal properties.}}
# [[mead]]; alcoholic drink fermented from honey and water

